{"strings": [
  {"text":"YE OTIS GHOSTE","translation":"ПРЫВІД ОТЫСАЎ","where":"worlds/the-canterville-ghost/scenes/tapestry/elements/turnip.js"},
  {"text":"Ye Onlie True and Originale Spook.","translation":"Адзіны сапраўдны і арыгінальны прывід.","where":"worlds/the-canterville-ghost/scenes/tapestry/elements/turnip.js"},
  {"text":"Beware of Ye Imitationes.","translation":"Сцеражыцеся падробак.","where":"worlds/the-canterville-ghost/scenes/tapestry/elements/turnip.js"},
  {"text":"All others are Counterfeite.","translation":"Усе астатнія — фальшыўкі.","where":"worlds/the-canterville-ghost/scenes/tapestry/elements/turnip.js"},
  {"text":"The Tapestry Chamber","translation":"Габеленавы пакой","where":"worlds/the-canterville-ghost/scenes/tapestry/scene.json title"},
  {"text":"Autumn, late in the afternoon. The door of the Tapestry Chamber stands ajar.","translation":"Восень, бліжэй да вечара. Дзверы Габеленавага пакоя прачыненыя.","where":"worlds/the-canterville-ghost/scenes/tapestry/scene.json caption"}
